Homepage: https://www.pinta-project.com
Description: Simple GTK4 paint and image editing program.
 Built from source with .NET 8 and libadwaita. Bundles the .NET 8 runtime
 in /opt/dotnet-pinta/ — no external dotnet package required. Features
 layers, effects, unlimited undo, and GNOME integration.
